Scope note

This MIT licence applies to the Beagle source code, documentation, and the
vendored `pi` frontend fork. It does NOT cover the optional `beagle-orpheus`
transport wheel, which is separately licensed proprietary software — free for
evaluation and limited single-use trials, paid for production or business
deployment. Beagle runs fully without it on the built-in HTTP transport;
installing it is always an explicit operator decision governed by that
distribution's own licence.
